{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":0,"color_scheme":"scheme-9edc9281-593b-4c13-ab00-ca80f6e5a7eb","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"hero_RmtTcd":{"type":"hero","blocks":{"text_ibnKbL":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>AVI\u00d3N CANNABIS: THE LEGACY</p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"7.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":40,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_meEehV":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Inspired by a true story.</p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1.25rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"spacer_QFPteC":{"type":"spacer","name":"t:names.spacer","settings":{"size":"percent","percent_size":40,"pixel_size":120,"custom_mobile_size":false,"size_mobile":"percent","percent_size_mobile":100,"pixel_size_mobile":120},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_ibnKbL","text_meEehV","spacer_QFPteC"],"name":"t:names.hero","settings":{"media_type_1":"image","image_1":"shopify://shop_images/OUR_STORY_-_AVION-02_8ccbb954-35cc-4385-8037-54664b9ce576.png","media_type_2":"image","stack_media_on_mobile":false,"custom_mobile_media":false,"media_type_1_mobile":"image","media_type_2_mobile":"image","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":16,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"full-screen","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"scheme-9edc9281-593b-4c13-ab00-ca80f6e5a7eb","toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#3a3a3c","overlay_style":"gradient","gradient_direction":"to top","blurred_reflection":false,"reflection_opacity":75,"padding-block-start":40,"padding-block-end":40}},"avion_floating_ekHwFe":{"type":"avion-floating","name":"Floating Icon","settings":{"icon_image":"shopify://shop_images/avion.png","icon_alt":"Avion Legacy","icon_size":280,"icon_size_mobile":50,"horizontal_position":50,"horizontal_position_mobile":18,"vertical_offset":-150,"vertical_offset_mobile":-75,"animation_speed":3,"float_distance":10,"show_shadow":true,"hide_on_mobile":true}},"pattern_avion_RmDpk6":{"type":"pattern-avion","name":"Avi\u00f3n Pattern Separador","settings":{"pattern_image":"shopify://shop_images/Pattern-our.png","bg_color":"#3a3a3c","pattern_height":45,"pattern_height_mobile":35,"opacity":100,"scroll_direction":"right","scroll_speed":50,"spacing_top":0,"spacing_bottom":0,"spacing_top_mobile":0,"spacing_bottom_mobile":0}},"hero_our_story_QTtMYp":{"type":"hero-our-story","name":"Avion story split","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/jerry-our-story.png","left_text":"<p>In 1977, Jerry Wilson sat at the controls of a DC4 military transport plane. He stared down a long narrow air strip, located deep in the vast Guarija desert of Northern Colombia. At the end of the runway stood an obstacle, one massive Oak Tree. 40,000 lbs of Cannabis was on board, and his business partners watched from the scrub, ak-47s slung over their shoulders.\u00a0</p><p>Heat waves rose from the clay and sweat beaded on his forehead. The Colombians made it clear, there was only one choice: fly the plane. He said to himself, as he had many times, \u201ctoday is a good day to die.\u201d He crossed his chest and thrust the plane forward.</p><p>Upon take off the right engine hit the Oak Tree, exploding immediately. He survived the crash landing but found himself in the notorious Santa Marta federal Prison. He was deemed by the national newspapers as \u201cEl Narcotrafficante Norteamericano Numero Dos.\u201d Translation: he was in deep shit. </p>","right_text":"<p>He escaped from prison on account of a friendly Judge and a handsome bribe. Jerry was the luckiest man I have ever known or known of.</p><p>This is one of his many harrowing adventures. Later he was acquitted in the trial of \u201cThe El Paso 10,\u201d where he stood trial for then the largest Marijuana bust in U.S. history. He went on to fly over 100,000 lbs of Cannabis into the United States.\u00a0</p><p>Through it all one thing remained unchanged: his love of Cannabis. He instilled his passion for cannabis in his children, who then instilled it in me, his grandson.\u00a0</p><p>Grandpa Jerry\u2019s stories and spirit are infused into every detail of this brand. Now, to ensure the legacy lives on, it is with a sense of deep purpose and gratitude that I present: Avi\u00f3n Legacy Cannabis.</p>","bg_color":"#fff3dc","text_color":"#fff3dc","section_height":660,"content_top_padding":84,"text_bottom_spacing":32,"side_padding":32,"font_size":16,"line_height":17,"letter_spacing":0,"section_height_tablet":600,"content_top_padding_tablet":60,"text_bottom_spacing_tablet":24,"side_padding_tablet":24,"font_size_tablet":14,"section_height_small_tablet":520,"content_top_padding_small_tablet":48,"text_bottom_spacing_small_tablet":20,"side_padding_small_tablet":20,"font_size_small_tablet":13,"mobile_image_height":500,"mobile_content_top_padding":52,"mobile_text_bottom_spacing":52,"mobile_side_padding":20,"mobile_text_gap":24,"mobile_font_size":16,"mobile_line_height":17,"mobile_letter_spacing":0,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"avion_legacy_split_GMLz47":{"type":"avion-legacy-split","disabled":true,"name":"Legacy Split Section","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/jerry_flying.png","image_alt":"Legacy image","heading":"THE MAN BEHIND THE LEGACY","heading_tag":"h2","body":"<p>Jerry Wilson was not just a pilot.</p><p>He was a risk-taker. A disruptor. A believer in freedom before it was fashionable.</p><p>To me, he was my grandfather.</p><p>To the headlines, he was something else entirely.</p><p>In the 1970s and 80s, Jerry flew cannabis from Mexico and Colombia into the United States.</p><p>Not quietly. Not carefully. Boldly.</p>","bg_color":"#a7322c","text_color":"#fff3dc","max_width":1400,"side_padding":24,"side_padding_mobile":18,"gap_desktop":60,"gap_mobile":26,"reverse_mobile":false,"image_radius":0,"pt_desktop":40,"pb_desktop":40,"pt_mobile":28,"pb_mobile":28,"heading_size_desktop":56,"heading_size_mobile":40,"heading_weight":700,"heading_line_height":105,"heading_letter_spacing":0,"body_size_desktop":16,"body_size_mobile":15,"body_weight":400,"body_line_height":160,"body_letter_spacing":0,"heading_spacing":18,"paragraph_spacing":12}},"section_gxgmKP":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_WHwtCW":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>THE CRASH THAT CHANGED EVERYTHING</p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"3.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":58,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_xcmktH":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>The crash happened while Jerry was out on bail for the El Paso 10 trial. A case involving 17 tons of cannabis, the largest seizure in U.S. history at the time.</p><p>The jury later acquitted all defendants after discovering law enforcement had stolen and resold the evidence.</p><p>History is rarely clean.<br/><br/>And it is almost never simple.<br/></p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_kyVDPz":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><br/>\u201cI was guilty as hell, but I wasn\u2019t ashamed at all.\u201d<br/>\u2014 Jerry Wilson<br/></p><p><br/></p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"2rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_WHwtCW","text_xcmktH","text_kyVDPz"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:names.custom_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"small","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"scheme-8c3fc9a1-aa65-49c8-9d1d-fb373b6cfc6c","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"avion_reinvention_split_dYRm4J":{"type":"avion-reinvention-split","disabled":true,"name":"Reinvention Split Section","settings":{"heading":"REINVENTION","heading_tag":"h2","body":"<p>Jerry didn\u2019t disappear after prison.</p><p>He built.</p><p>He used his earnings to fund Soloflex, a fitness company that would redefine American advertising.</p><p>Later, he invested heavily in cannabis legalization efforts, serving as chief petitioner in Oregon and running for governor in 2005.</p><p>From the shadows into advocacy.</p><p>From outlaw to organizer.</p><p>From risk to reform.</p>","image":"shopify://shop_images/soloflex-machine.jpg","image_alt":"Reinvention image","match_text_height":true,"image_fit":"cover","image_position":"center","image_radius":0,"image_max_width_desktop":390,"image_max_width_mobile":300,"image_align":"center","bg_color":"#fff3dc","text_color":"#cc4137","max_width":1400,"text_max_width":520,"side_padding":24,"side_padding_mobile":18,"gap_desktop":72,"gap_mobile":26,"content_align":"center","reverse_mobile":false,"pt_desktop":0,"pb_desktop":40,"pt_mobile":28,"pb_mobile":28,"heading_size_desktop":56,"heading_size_mobile":40,"heading_weight":700,"heading_line_height":105,"heading_letter_spacing":0,"body_size_desktop":16,"body_size_mobile":15,"body_weight":400,"body_line_height":160,"body_letter_spacing":0,"heading_spacing":18,"paragraph_spacing":12}},"section_9DFBjU":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_3Wq77N":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>WHY AVI\u00d3N CANNABIS LEGACY</p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"3.5rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_nwHwfQ":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><br/>Avi\u00f3n was never created to glorify crime.<br/>It was created to honor resilience.<br/><br/>To acknowledge complexity.<br/><br/>To preserve a chapter of cannabis history that shaped the industry we stand in today. </p><p>The legal market exists because people once took illegal risks.</p><p>You wouldn\u2019t believe how many of the businesses you recognize today were funded by smugglers.</p><p>Avi\u00f3n <strong>is not </strong>about nostalgia.<br/><br/><strong>It\u2019s about acknowledging </strong>where this culture came from \u2014 and where it\u2019s going.<br/><br/></p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_3Wq77N","text_nwHwfQ"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:names.custom_section","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"small","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"scheme-8c3fc9a1-aa65-49c8-9d1d-fb373b6cfc6c","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"pattern_avion_xjKT8R":{"type":"pattern-avion","name":"Avi\u00f3n Pattern Separador"